ich wrote:
> Frank Sackewitz wrote:
> It just cant find a module called char-"something". I cant find any serious
> errors in/var/log/messages nor other files in this directory.

probably char-major-10-135.  that's the rtc

you can add to your /etc/modules.conf:

alias char-major-10-135 rtc

or

alias char-major-10-135 off

I have it aliased to rtc, but off would probably work without incident 
also (it would basically suppress the warning messages)

